OL,3,GNEWSATwo people killed in plane crash
OL,4,Anamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people who died in a plane crash
OL,7,Fhave been named by a coroner.
OL,9,FSheetal Swali and Ketan Swali, in their
OL,10,F50s, were pronounced dead at the scene
OL,11,Fafter a light aircraft they were in was
OL,12,Ffound at a remote location close to
OL,13,FTrawsfynydd, Gwynedd.
OL,15,FAir and ground searches were carried
OL,16,Fout to find the plane after North Wales
OL,17,FPolice was told just after 12:00 BST on
OL,18,FFriday that an aircraft travelling from
OL,19,Fan airfield in England had not arrived
OL,20,Fat Caernarfon Airport as scheduled.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
